WEBVTT

00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:08.500
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:09.493 --> 00:00:10.607
<v><b>M:</b></v> <b>Call</b> me <b>tonight</b>.

00:00:12.522 --> 00:00:13.215
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:14.125 --> 00:00:15.360
<v><b>F:</b></v> <b>Can</b> you <b>help</b> us?

00:00:17.267 --> 00:00:18.000
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:18.967 --> 00:00:20.267
<v><b>M:</b></v> <b>Don’t listen</b> to <b>her</b>.

00:00:22.213 --> 00:00:22.979
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:23.944 --> 00:00:25.152
<v><b>F:</b></v> <b>See</b> you <b>later</b>.

00:00:27.022 --> 00:00:27.795
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:28.727 --> 00:00:30.155
<v><b>M:</b></v> <b>I don’t like</b> them.

00:00:32.089 --> 00:00:32.910
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:33.868 --> 00:00:35.299
<v><b>F:</b></v> <b>Don’t think</b> about it.

00:00:37.208 --> 00:00:37.999
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:00:38.938 --> 00:00:40.073
<v><b>M:</b></v> <b>Give it</b> to <b>him</b>.